Speaker diarization toolkit

Usage: polyvoice <COMMAND>

Commands:
  diarize          Run diarization on a WAV file
  download-models  Download Mobile/Balanced ONNX models
  models           Inspect models registry
  help             Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
